Model viewer

Install libgpu, libtinygl, libraylib and libraygui (boot/GPU.md), then:

    cd /sys/src/cmd/modelview
    mk install
    modelview
    modelview /path/to/model.glb
    modelview -n 120 -o /tmp/model.png /path/to/model.obj

Run in rio with VirGL. With no file, the viewer shows a torus.
See modelview(1) for formats, controls, animation timing and material limits.
No model assets are bundled. New code uses the repository's root LICENSE.
